-- A named site and a construction that leave out a TYPICALLY default
-- (TYPICALLY-ONE-BEHAVIOUR-SPEC.md W4, W5). The checker adds the default as one
-- more argument the author did not write; the Check phase below must still have
-- tokens for this file, and none at the place the default was declared.

GIVEN rate IS A NUMBER TYPICALLY 3
      base IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
scaled MEANS rate TIMES base

DECLARE Colour IS ONE OF Red, Green

DECLARE Paint
  HAS colour IS A Colour TYPICALLY Red
      coats  IS A NUMBER

GIVETH A NUMBER
`one` MEANS scaled WITH base IS 1

GIVETH A Paint
`two` MEANS Paint WITH coats IS 2

#EVAL `one`
